      "message": "test(app): bench the playback cost on the fig8 2D Offset and a 3D Pocket\n\nAdd ignored heavy-lane benches that walk each program as a playing\nworker does: a chunk of moves (FieldPlay::seek, the worker's chunk law),\nthen one publication (take_dirty, view, pack_cut_patch or pack_cut).\nThey print the lattice, the moves, ms for each chunk and each move, the\nCutStats counters, ms for each pack, and the share of each part. A third\nbench repeats the walks at 1/4 and 1/2 of the display budget. No wall\ntime is asserted. No product code changes.\n\nRefs #3336\nFixes #3365\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
